    "steam_appid": 3183230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/aa542f70617b318d76229ddc3d2411b0.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Strikers</strong> is a <strong>stylish 3D action fighting game</strong> that\u2019s easy to pick up yet deep to master. Featuring high-mobility combat and flashy combo effects, players can choose their side and battle across cyber-fantasy arenas where dodging and chaining attacks combine into intense combat moments. Whether in solo arcade challenges or local 1v1 battles, each match delivers fast-paced, accessible action. Every fight is a clash of conviction and obsession.<strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/0a59f09a4798bcb99d99285251806fc8.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts stunning visual performance\u2014from dynamic facial animations and combat lighting effects to intricate scene details, all designed to deliver realism and impact. With high-end rendering, every battle feels like a cinematic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/05cfaa5018bfbd661a4c90ef0e0fdc76.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional fighters, <strong>Dream Strikers</strong> features a dual camera system that dynamically switches between 2D and 3D perspectives, preserving combo freedom while highlighting movement and action detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/d1e1464c1c4307ef755a0eee7fb0fb6c.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the moment is right, unleash your power with <strong>Ultimate Finishers</strong>\u2014high-impact cinematic attacks that can turn the tide in an instant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/ea867da7d1b9470514885bed14ba891d.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system <strong>encourages players to freely combine skills based on the flow of battle</strong>, allowing for unique styles and strategies. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned player, there\u2019s depth to explore, and each character brings distinct mechanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/74d6bc69f9b248686d6e6b087230f6ca.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse cast of characters, each with unique stories and fighting styles, players will experience a world full of challenges and emotion. As the narrative unfolds, uncover hidden truths and confront the nightmares that lurk in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 1v1 multiplayer for head-to-head matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo arcade mode with custom-designed AI challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters with distinct moves and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 immersive dream-themed battle stages including skies, ruins, and cyber cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced mobility combat and cinematic finishing moves in every match.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/aa542f70617b318d76229ddc3d2411b0.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Strikers</strong> is a <strong>stylish 3D action fighting game</strong> that\u2019s easy to pick up yet deep to master. Featuring high-mobility combat and flashy combo effects, players can choose their side and battle across cyber-fantasy arenas where dodging and chaining attacks combine into intense combat moments. Whether in solo arcade challenges or local 1v1 battles, each match delivers fast-paced, accessible action. Every fight is a clash of conviction and obsession.<strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/0a59f09a4798bcb99d99285251806fc8.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts stunning visual performance\u2014from dynamic facial animations and combat lighting effects to intricate scene details, all designed to deliver realism and impact. With high-end rendering, every battle feels like a cinematic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/05cfaa5018bfbd661a4c90ef0e0fdc76.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional fighters, <strong>Dream Strikers</strong> features a dual camera system that dynamically switches between 2D and 3D perspectives, preserving combo freedom while highlighting movement and action detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/d1e1464c1c4307ef755a0eee7fb0fb6c.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the moment is right, unleash your power with <strong>Ultimate Finishers</strong>\u2014high-impact cinematic attacks that can turn the tide in an instant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/ea867da7d1b9470514885bed14ba891d.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system <strong>encourages players to freely combine skills based on the flow of battle</strong>, allowing for unique styles and strategies. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned player, there\u2019s depth to explore, and each character brings distinct mechanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.poster.avif?t=1754406059\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.webm?t=1754406059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/74d6bc69f9b248686d6e6b087230f6ca.avif?t=1754406059\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse cast of characters, each with unique stories and fighting styles, players will experience a world full of challenges and emotion. As the narrative unfolds, uncover hidden truths and confront the nightmares that lurk in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 1v1 multiplayer for head-to-head matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo arcade mode with custom-designed AI challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters with distinct moves and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 immersive dream-themed battle stages including skies, ruins, and cyber cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced mobility combat and cinematic finishing moves in every match.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dream Strikers is a high-mobility 3D action fighting game set in a cyber-fantasy world. Choose to become a Hunter of conviction or fall into darkness as a Nightmare. Execute fast-paced combos, dodge skillfully, and finish with ultimate moves in a clash of belief and obsession.",
